      "role": "body",
      "text": "EF-Series storage coupled with Lustre parallel file system delivers ultra‑high‑throughput, low‑latency shared storage that scales performance for the most demanding high-performance-computing and AI workloads, for example acting as high-speed scratch space in neocloud environments.",
